@startuml
' Source of truth for: assets/diagrams/learning/data-plane/ngfw/feature-arc-pipeline.svg
' Re-render with: plantuml -tsvg feature-arc-pipeline.puml
title VPP Packet Graph & the ip4-unicast Feature Arc\n(custom firewall nodes plug into the ordered arc)

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam rectangleRoundCorner 8
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

rectangle "dpdk-input\n(input node: polls NIC)" as N0 #f1f5f9
rectangle "ip4-input\n(parse + validate)" as N1 #f1f5f9

package "ip4-unicast feature arc (ordered, per-interface)" {
  rectangle "acl-plugin\nclassify -> steering tag" as N2 #ffffff
  rectangle "**ngfw-decision**\npolicy -> action\n(CUSTOM)" as N3 #ecfdf5
  rectangle "snort-ip4-input\nhand to IPS" as N4 #fff1f2
  rectangle "**ngfw-post-snort**\nact on verdict\n(CUSTOM)" as N5 #ecfdf5
  rectangle "nat44 / nat66\ntranslate addresses" as N6 #ffffff
}

rectangle "ip4-lookup\nroute (FIB)" as N7 #f1f5f9
rectangle "interface-output\nto NIC tx" as N8 #f1f5f9

N0 -> N1 -> N2 -> N3 -> N4 -> N5 -> N6 -> N7 -> N8

note bottom of N3
ngfw-decision exits:
- continue arc -> snort (inspect)
- pass -> ip4-lookup
- encrypt -> esp4-encrypt
- drop -> error-drop
writes a note to opaque2 if inspecting
end note

note bottom of N5
ngfw-post-snort exits (reads cookie 0xAB):
- pass -> ip4-lookup
- NAT -> nat
- encrypt -> esp4-encrypt
no cookie? just continue the arc
end note

legend top
ngfw-decision registers runs_before snort · ngfw-post-snort registers runs_after snort
endlegend
@enduml
